  "description": "Coaster brake nirvana. Take the most fun hardtail. Take the most fun brake. Take the most fun fork. Ride this and try not having more fun than you've ever had on a mountain bike. Coaster brake La Roca.\n\n150mm of plushness. Maxxis 29 2.6 minions. La Roca trail candy geo. This thing is rowdy before the coaster brake.\n\nClean (Light AF) bars with suicide dropper. Vintage turbo selle saddle. Dripping with drip bebe.\n\nAn insert in the rear for the big hits… what stops this? Not much…short of a huge skid.\n\nWhat else? Carbon cranks.. Cane creek slamset.. 45mm funnduro stem. My fave pnw grips.\n\nThis is exactly how Id build mine…kinda the concept here. It's a medium. We could make you something similar in your size…shout me a holler.",
